  "nodes": {
    "opening": {
      "node_id": "opening",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "narration": "门上的铜铃响过一声，店里又静下来。前厅只点了两盏壁灯，光贴着玻璃柜和深色货架往下落，银烟盒、旧表链、小瓷像分开放着，标签上的墨迹有些褪色。柜台旁没有别的顾客，街上的车声隔着厚窗帘变得很低。后屋传来一次木箱挪动的轻响，随后是纸张摩擦声，但门帘没有掀开，也没有人走出来。维克从一排高柜旁转身，扣好袖口，向你微微欠身。他的外套剪裁整齐，手杖靠在柜台内侧，指尖停在一只铜放大镜旁，没有立刻拿起。古龙水的气味先到，甜而浓，靠近柜台时，底下又有一丝很淡的酸味，像从衣料里慢慢散出。你站在入口和柜台之间，左手边是杂项古玩，右手边的窄架上夹着几本旧书，书脊没有朝外摆全。\n\n「欢迎光临。今日店里清静，您可以慢慢看。」\n\n「后面只是在收拾货箱，不会打扰我们。」\n\n「您是对钟表、银器有兴趣，还是想找几本像样的旧书？若是为某件特定东西来的，也不妨先说个范围。」",
      "speaker_ref": "char_vick",
      "location_ref": "scene_vick_antique_shop",
      "on_enter_effects": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "option_id": "opt_opening_1",
          "text": "我随便看看，也收旧书。",
          "target_node_id": "soft_customer_probe_b1",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        },
        {
          "option_id": "opt_opening_2",
          "text": "我想谈稀有书和手稿。",
          "target_node_id": "business_entry_b1",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        },
        {
          "option_id": "opt_opening_3",
          "text": "我来问莱特教授。",
          "target_node_id": "sharp_name_test_b1",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        },
        {
          "option_id": "opt_opening_4",
          "text": "有人介绍我谈隐秘收购。",
          "target_node_id": "business_entry_b1",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        },
        {
          "option_id": "opt_opening_5",
          "text": "我听说已有对家出价。",
          "target_node_id": "sharp_name_test_b1",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        }
      ]
    },
    "soft_customer_probe_b1": {
      "node_id": "soft_customer_probe_b1",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "narration": "维克从柜台后取出一只扁平木盒，银扣擦得发亮。他没有急着打开，只把盒子转到灯下，让标签上的旧墨迹先进入你的视线。\n\n「看得出您不是来买装饰书的人。能问一句，您是替哪位藏家看货，还是自己有目录要补？」",
      "speaker_ref": "char_vick",
      "location_ref": "scene_vick_antique_shop",
      "on_enter_effects": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "option_id": "opt_soft_customer_probe_b1_continue",
          "text": "先看货。",
          "target_node_id": "soft_customer_probe_b2",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        }
      ]
    },
    "soft_customer_probe_b2": {
      "node_id": "soft_customer_probe_b2",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "narration": "木盒里垫着暗红绒布，一枚小型书票夹在玻璃片下。维克用指节轻敲盒沿，动作很轻，像是在提醒你注意纸张边缘。\n\n「莱特教授懂这种东西。稀有书、手稿、私人藏本，我们做过不止一回。」\n\n「有时他卖，有时他替人打听；我也替客户转过几次话。」",
      "speaker_ref": "char_vick",
      "location_ref": "scene_vick_antique_shop",
      "on_enter_effects": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "option_id": "opt_soft_customer_probe_b2_continue",
          "text": "他常找你？",
          "target_node_id": "soft_customer_probe_b3",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        }
      ]
    },
    "soft_customer_probe_b3": {
      "node_id": "soft_customer_probe_b3",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "narration": "维克绕出柜台，把玻璃片递近。古龙水的气味随他靠近压过来，底下那丝酸味也清楚了一点；后屋的轻响很快停住。\n\n「常不常，要看您从哪里听来的名字。」\n\n「莱特教授知道我有客户，也知道我能把书和手稿送到愿意出价的人面前。」",
      "speaker_ref": "char_vick",
      "location_ref": "scene_vick_antique_shop",
      "on_enter_effects": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "option_id": "opt_soft_customer_probe_b3_continue",
          "text": "我记下了。",
          "target_node_id": "soft_followup_choice",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        }
      ]
    },
    "soft_followup_choice": {
      "node_id": "soft_followup_choice",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "narration": "柜台上的绿色灯罩把光压在账册和玻璃纸镇上，店门外的街声隔着厚窗变得很低。维克没有再站回柜台后方，而是停在侧面的高脚凳旁，手套搭在膝上，指节慢慢抚平皮革边缘。你面前那只打开的木盒仍摆着几枚铜章和两张空白标价签，留出一小块可以放名片或清单的位置。墙钟走到整点前，齿轮轻轻卡了一声；门帘没有掀动，后面的影子也没有靠近。维克的目光在你的袖口、口袋鼓起处和你没有碰过的茶杯之间停留，随后落回桌面。他把一支铅笔横放在账册上，笔尖朝向你，像是在给谈话划出一条可进可退的线。\n\n「莱特教授的往来有许多种。您问的是装订、来源、转手，还是某一类纸页？」\n\n「在这一行，问题问得太整齐，反而像替别人量尺寸。」\n\n「您若愿意先说能给我什么样的方便，我也许能省去几句客套。」\n\n「有些材料适合挂在目录上，有些只适合在桌边低声谈。」",
      "speaker_ref": "char_vick",
      "location_ref": "scene_vick_antique_shop",
      "on_enter_effects": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "option_id": "opt_soft_followup_choice_1",
          "text": "我可交换，他怎样经手？",
          "target_node_id": "soft_trade_detail_b1",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        },
        {
          "option_id": "opt_soft_followup_choice_2",
          "text": "我想知文书为何总经他。",
          "target_node_id": "soft_trade_detail_b1",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        },
        {
          "option_id": "opt_soft_followup_choice_3",
          "text": "我看你不只当它旧纸。",
          "target_node_id": "soft_uncanny_detail_b1",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        },
        {
          "option_id": "opt_soft_followup_choice_4",
          "text": "我只问不宜公开的部分。",
          "target_node_id": "soft_uncanny_detail_b1",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        },
        {
          "option_id": "opt_soft_followup_choice_5",
          "text": "我想听钱，还是传闻？",
          "target_node_id": "soft_trade_detail_b1",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        }
      ]
    },
    "soft_trade_detail_b1": {
      "node_id": "soft_trade_detail_b1",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "narration": "维克把一只银质镇纸推到桌角，留出账册大小的一块空处。后屋的细响停了，玻璃柜里的铜扣在灯下发暗。他没有拿笔，只用指节轻轻点了点桌面。\n\n「那批文书如今不是一桩买卖，是一场竞标。价格已经到数千美元，而且还没有停。」\n\n「莱特教授生前很懂这种局面。可惜我还不知道，他最后把多少事带进了坟墓。」",
      "speaker_ref": "char_vick",
      "location_ref": "scene_vick_antique_shop",
      "on_enter_effects": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "option_id": "opt_soft_trade_detail_b1_continue",
          "text": "还有谁出价？",
          "target_node_id": "soft_trade_detail_b2",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        }
      ]
    },
    "soft_trade_detail_b2": {
      "node_id": "soft_trade_detail_b2",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "narration": "维克抬眼看了看门缝，又把视线收回到你身上。他的手套边缘压着桌面，古龙水的甜味盖在近处，那丝酸味仍从底下透出来。\n\n「我只是代理人。真正感兴趣的几位，口袋比我深得多。」\n\n「你若问姓名，我只能说他们多半是外国人。顺便问一句，教授的遗体现在由谁看管？」",
      "speaker_ref": "char_vick",
      "location_ref": "scene_vick_antique_shop",
      "on_enter_effects": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "option_id": "opt_soft_trade_detail_b2_continue",
          "text": "为什么问遗体？",
          "target_node_id": "soft_trade_detail_b3",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        }
      ]
    },
    "soft_trade_detail_b3": {
      "node_id": "soft_trade_detail_b3",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "narration": "维克没有立刻回答。他把镇纸转了半圈，底座在木面上磨出很轻的一声。柜台后的帘子垂着，没有人出来。\n\n「生意人总要确认一件事是否已经没人能反悔。」\n\n「若文书原件出现，我仍愿出数千美元。不问出处，不问中间经过，只要东西是真的。」",
      "speaker_ref": "char_vick",
      "location_ref": "scene_vick_antique_shop",
      "on_enter_effects": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "option_id": "opt_soft_trade_detail_b3_continue",
          "text": "我记下了。",
          "target_node_id": "end_soft_trade",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        }
      ]
    },
    "end_soft_trade": {
      "node_id": "end_soft_trade",
      "type": "end",
      "narration": "店门外的街声从门缝里挤进来，又被厚玻璃挡住。柜台上的绿罩灯还亮着，维克把那张写有报价和联络方式的便笺推到你手边，随后合上账册，在封皮内侧夹进一张空白名片。你离开时，门铃轻响；橱窗里的旧书脊在灯下排成一线，身后的钥匙转进锁孔。\n\n「有原件消息，就按上面的地址找我。」维克说。\n\n「别急着告诉别人你知道多少。这样对你我都方便。」",
      "speaker_ref": "char_vick",
      "location_ref": "scene_vick_antique_shop",
      "on_enter_effects": [],
      "options": []
    },
    "soft_uncanny_detail_b1": {
      "node_id": "soft_uncanny_detail_b1",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "narration": "维克把展示盒合上，银扣轻轻一响。他没有回到柜台后面，只把一只薄账本从抽屉里推出来，封皮边角磨得发亮。\n\n「莱特教授不是偶尔来一次的卖家。稀有书、手稿，我同他做过不止几笔。」\n\n「有些东西我自己收，有些东西，我替真正愿意付钱的人牵线。」",
      "speaker_ref": "char_vick",
      "location_ref": "scene_vick_antique_shop",
      "on_enter_effects": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "option_id": "opt_soft_uncanny_detail_b1_continue",
          "text": "那批文书？",
          "target_node_id": "soft_uncanny_detail_b2",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        }
      ]
    },
    "soft_uncanny_detail_b2": {
      "node_id": "soft_uncanny_detail_b2",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "narration": "后屋的帘子静了一会儿，煤气灯在玻璃罩里发出细小的响声。维克用指腹压住账本边缘，没有翻开。\n\n「那批文书已经不只是买卖，是一场竞标。价钱早过了几千美元，还在往上走。」\n\n「我可以告诉你，我只是代理人。买主在海那边，外国人，胃口很大。」",
      "speaker_ref": "char_vick",
      "location_ref": "scene_vick_antique_shop",
      "on_enter_effects": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "option_id": "opt_soft_uncanny_detail_b2_continue",
          "text": "谁在抬价？",
          "target_node_id": "soft_uncanny_detail_b3",
          "condition": null,
          "effects": [],
          "unavailable_behavior": "hide"
        }
      ]
    },
    "soft_uncanny_detail_b3": {
      "node_id": "soft_uncanny_detail_b3",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "narration": "维克抬眼看了看门口，又把账本收回抽屉。古龙水的香气停在桌面附近，底下那丝酸味随着他的靠近更清楚。\n\n「最高价是谁推的，现在说出来没有好处。」\n\n「但原件若能送到我这里，几千美元可以马上谈。出处、经过、谁先拿到，我都不问。」",
      "speaker_ref": "char_vick",
      "location_ref": "scene_vick_antique_shop",
      "on_enter_effects": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "option_id": "opt_soft_uncanny_detail_b3_continue",
          "text": "我记下了。",
